# REST Client (VS Code) requests for application-service — for clicking through by hand.
# The full automated run with every status code is tests/api-tests.js (npm run test:api).
# Put your API id below (printed by deploy.sh). Locally use http://localhost:3000.
@baseUrl = http://REPLACE_API_ID.execute-api.localhost.floci.io:4566
# Phase A test users (shared-lib/auth.js): test-student-1, test-student-2, test-reviewer, test-admin
@student = test-student-1

### Browse published scholarships → 200 [...]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scholarships
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### Search → 200 (only titles/descriptions containing "merit")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scholarships?search=merit
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### One scholarship → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scholarships/test-open
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### A draft is hidden → 404 SCHOLARSHIP_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scholarships/test-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### No token → 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scholarships

### Apply with the wrong Content-Type → 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### Apply as admin → 403 FORBIDDEN (and a "forbidden" row in AuditLog)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer test-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Apply with a short essay → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scholarshipId": "test-open", "essay": "too short", "gpa": 3.2, "yearOfStudy": 2, "pdfBase64": "JVBERi0xLjQK" }

### My applications (with timeline) → 200 [...]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### Download my PDF → 200 { url, expiresIn: 300 }   (paste an applicationId from "mine")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/PASTE_ID/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### Same PDF as another student → 404 APPLICATION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/PASTE_ID/pdf
Authorization: Bearer test-student-2

### Withdraw → 204 (only while submitted and before the deadline)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/PASTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
